    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικρᾰτ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grasping, tenacious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμφηλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simm.
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; <i>having full command over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γενέσθαι τῆς σκάφης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					27.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>Su.</u>
				39
			</span></i> (v.l.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικρεμής</span>.</div>
